  "user_request_original": "Optimize an 8-layer planar dielectric stack on Ge substrate with Air incidence under normal-incidence unpolarized illumination. Layer sequence: ZnSe, ZnS, ZnSe, ZnS, ZnSe, ZnS, ZnSe, ZnS (8 finite layers). Initialize thicknesses at [429.3362593672488, 71.05139362686491, 69.55218027927222, 50.322318469392705, 674.5855881008958, 71.37520311661459, 49.22708022962166, 548.5304563299314] nm. Constrain each layer thickness to ±0.5 nm around initialization. Optimize for maximum mean transmittance in 8000-11000 nm band and minimum mean transmittance in 3000-5000 nm band. Apply gradient-based optimizer with thickness variance regularization penalty. Evaluate candidates using coherent transfer-matrix formalism. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 8000-11000 nm, 3000-5000 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 8000-11000 nm band; Low transmittance in 3000-5000 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: High transmittance in 3000-5000 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Total layer count not exceeding 16.",
